  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant)",
