  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation is <math><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Using integration by parts, we get,<br /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p>",
